meta {
  name: 11 Chat Runs
  seq: 12
}

docs {
  The turn routes of `/api/chats/{id}`: reattaching (`stream`), stop, regenerate, and retry. An
  idle chat streams nothing (`204`) and stops at once; user B (`otherToken`) gets `404` for user
  A's chat on every one of them, never `CHAT_BUSY`. Bruno has no model provider, so its chat
  cannot answer; the route tests on Postgres cover live runs, reattaching after a `seq`, stop,
  regenerate, retry, edits, the shutdown drain, and recovery after a restart.
}
